# Evidence bundles are content-addressed and reproducible; the artefacts are not committed.
/artifacts/
/evidence/

# NOT ignored, deliberately:
#   analyser/requirements.lock        the resolved graph is the point
#   analyser/evals/corpus/digests.json  the determinism anchor CI asserts against
#   analyser/evals/baseline.json      the forecast-accuracy anchor
#   config/instances.json             pinned prices, read at analysis time
